# Whitelist repo: ~/.local/bin holds far more than the status bar — vendored
# binaries, symlinks into plugin caches, one-off helpers, some of which touch
# credentials. Ignore everything, then name exactly what belongs here, so no
# stray `git add` can sweep in something that should never leave this machine.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

!brightness
!brightness-down
!brightness-up
!cc-usage
!cpu
!codex-usage
!energy
!energy-charts
!gpu
!ping-artix
!pogoda
!volume
!weather
